---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import WaButton from "../components/WaButton.astro";
import { orgSchema, breadcrumbs } from "../lib/schema";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---
<Base
  title="About Us | Local Tanzania Safari Company in Arusha | Golden Dust Safaris"
  description="We're a local Tanzania safari company in Arusha. Serengeti safari tours, family safaris and Tanzania safari holidays across all 22 national parks, including Ruaha and Katavi."
  schema={[orgSchema, breadcrumbs([["Home", "/"], ["About us", "/about"]])]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <h1>About Golden Dust Safaris</h1>
      <p class="lede">We're a small, local Tanzania safari company based in Arusha. Tanzania is home for us, and showing it to people properly is what we love doing.</p>
      <div class="measure">

      <p>We're a TALA-registered operator. There's no agency in the middle, so when you book with us, your money goes into your safari, not into a chain of commissions.</p>

      <h2>Two guides, not a hundred</h2>
      <p>This is our biggest plus. We don't work with a hundred guides. We have two. When you book a safari with us, your trip is planned by the same guide who travels with you, and he's the one who picks you up at the airport.</p>
      <p>So you know what the experience will be like before you even book. You've already spoken to the person who'll be with you every day, deciding where you go, when you leave camp and how long you stay with a pride of lions. Most companies don't work this way: you'd normally meet your guide for the first time on the morning of day one.</p>
      <p>We don't believe in volume. We're a small company, and we only take as many bookings as our two guides can handle.</p>

      <h2>More than the famous three parks</h2>
      <p>Almost everyone hears the same three names: the Serengeti, Ngorongoro Crater and Tarangire. They're famous for good reason, and our Serengeti safari tours are still the trips we run most. But Tanzania has 22 national parks, and some of the most memorable ones are the quiet ones. Ruaha is wild and vast with far fewer vehicles. Katavi is one of the most remote places you can go on safari in Africa. If one of them suits you better, we'll tell you.</p>

      <h2>Safaris for families, couples and first-timers</h2>
      <p>A family safari in Tanzania needs a different pace from a photography trip or a honeymoon. Shorter drives, the right lodges, a guide who's great with kids. We plan around who's coming, not around a fixed package. Whether it's a short Serengeti and Ngorongoro trip or a longer Tanzania safari holiday across several parks, every itinerary starts from a conversation.</p>

      <h2>How we like to work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We usually start with a call to understand what you want and why Tanzania is calling you.</li>
        <li>We tell you honestly which parks are worth it for you, and which ones you can skip.</li>
        <li>You get a full cost breakdown, so you know exactly what you're paying for.</li>
        <li>Real photos of our vehicles, not stock images.</li>
        <li>Direct WhatsApp contact with your guide, who is also the one planning your trip.</li>
        <li>Got a quote from another company? Send it over and we'll give you our honest opinion, even if you end up booking with them.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Want to see what our trips really look like? Follow us on <a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram ({site.instagramHandle})</a>, or read what <a href="/#rv-h">our guests say</a>.</p>

      <div class="about__cta">
        <WaButton label="Say hello on WhatsApp" />
        <a href="/tanzania-safari-packages" class="btn btn--ghost">See example safaris</a>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about h2 { margin-top: 2.2rem; font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .about ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .about li { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
  .about__cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
